# Exclude this test on macOS
#
# This test uses features that may not be available or behave differently
# on macOS compared to Linux. Specifically:
# - Process management (pkill, pgrep) behavior differs
# - IPC cleanup (sm_ipc_stop) may have timing differences
# - Signal handling for daemon termination varies
#
# The bulk removal functions themselves should work on macOS, but the
# test infrastructure relies on Linux-specific process management.
